{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor completed all six responsibility-chain items without any serious or minor error, safely handled obstetric red flags, high-risk context, levothyroxine safety, fetal hydrocephalus uncertainty, executable planning and record grounding. However, no high-order point was validly completed beyond the minimum safe duties; the trajectory exhibits strong real-world adaptation and clinical reasoning but the evidence does not show a completed, beyond-minimum HO with active model action and meaningful trajectory impact. Therefore grade 3 is the highest achievable under the rubric.",
