      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with the family having a concrete, time-bound, and safety-netted plan: they know what to do tonight, what to bring to appointments, when to seek emergency care, and how to handle levothyroxine. The doctor confirms understanding step-by-step and provides a simplified checklist.",
